L1: Redox correlation in muscle lengthening and immune response in eccentric exercise
L2: PLoS ONE (2018)
L3: Feng He, Chia-Chen Chuang, Tingyang Zhou, Qing Jiang, Darlene A. Sedlock, Li Zuo
L4: 1 
L5:  Department of Health and Kinesiology, College of Health and Human Sciences, Purdue University, West Lafayette, IN, United States of America
